      10["Pobyt Service (Visit + Faraway)<br/>[Container: TypeScript, NestJS]<br/>Board frames Visit + Faraway:<br/>check-in, checkout,<br/>replacement room, room<br/>complaints; keeps its own<br/>copy of today's arrivals and<br/>room status (events from<br/>Rezerwacje) and builds the<br/>reception emergency list from<br/>it every 15 min (file +<br/>e-mail); smart-lock adapter:<br/>lock-to-room mapping, issues<br/>and revokes mobile keys<br/>(guest: check-in to checkout;<br/>housekeeper: assigned room,<br/>for the task)."]
      style 10 fill:#438dd5,stroke:#2e6295,color:#ffffff
      6["Staff Back-office<br/>[Container: TypeScript, React SPA]<br/>Phone and walk-in bookings on<br/>the same path as guests<br/>(phone: the guest gets a<br/>payment link), check-in /<br/>out, room board, cart queue<br/>panel."]
      style 6 fill:#438dd5,stroke:#2e6295,color:#ffffff
      7["Housekeeping Cart App<br/>[Container: Offline web app, IndexedDB]<br/>Ordered room list with guest<br/>wishes and defects; works<br/>offline, sends updates when<br/>Wi-Fi is back."]
      style 7 fill:#438dd5,stroke:#2e6295,color:#ffffff
      8["Rezerwacje Service<br/>[Container: TypeScript, NestJS]<br/>Board frame Rezerwacja + room<br/>availability and status: the<br/>only place that can take a<br/>room for a night (one<br/>transaction); holds the room<br/>10 min while the guest<br/>pre-authorises the payment at<br/>the payment operator,<br/>confirmed by webhook; never<br/>waits for legacy; computes<br/>when every hotel room is<br/>needed next."]
      style 8 fill:#438dd5,stroke:#2e6295,color:#ffffff
      9["Housekeeping Service<br/>[Container: TypeScript, NestJS]<br/>Board frames Housekeeping +<br/>Servis tech: one queue for<br/>cleaning and repairs,<br/>priority from when the room<br/>is needed next; API for cart<br/>devices. Keeps its own copy<br/>of room status and room<br/>needed-by (events from<br/>Rezerwacje), so it works on<br/>the last known state while<br/>Rezerwacje is down."]
      style 9 fill:#438dd5,stroke:#2e6295,color:#ffffff
    end

